[2026-06-24T11:21:45.668Z] [STDOUT] [{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/start/issues/comments/4788275944","html_url":"https://github.com/link-foundation/start/issues/140#issuecomment-4788275944","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/start/issues/140","id":4788275944,"node_id":"IC_kwDOP85RQM8AAAABHWdK6A","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T10:26:41Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T10:26:41Z","body":"Downstream companion issue filed: link-assistant/hive-mind#1979 — Hive Mind runs `$ --isolated docker --detached --session <uuid>` per task, hits the detached path that preserves the container by default, and never reaps it; finished task containers accumulate multi-GB writable layers (~35 GB observed on one host). It can implement success/failure-aware removal on its own exit-status detection, but making removal the default here (with the log kept) is the upstream fix.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/start/issues/comments/4788275944/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/start/issues/comments/4788401706","html_url":"https://github.com/link-foundation/start/issues/140#issuecomment-4788401706","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/start/issues/140","id":4788401706,"node_id":"IC_kwDOP85RQM8AAAABHWk2Kg","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T10:42:56Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T10:42:56Z","body":"We should have `--keep-container`, and `--always-cleanup-container` - the default, and also `--keep-container-on-fail` which should be the same as `--auto-remove-docker-container`.\n\nSo by default we should cleanup at the moment, later we may reconsider, but all configuration options should be available now, so later it will be easy to switch.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/start/issues/comments/4788401706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via